if it's the tyroid that's happening,

00:04:56.650 --> 00:04:57.730
if it's something else,

00:04:57.730 --> 00:05:00.200
if it's just the caffeine
is to rule it out

00:05:00.200 --> 00:05:01.690
by asking you questions.

00:05:01.690 --> 00:05:03.632
When does it happen, how
often does it happen,

00:05:03.632 --> 00:05:06.036
what other associated
symptoms are going on?

00:05:06.036 --> 00:05:08.950
Then doing a physical exam,
listening to your heart,

00:05:08.950 --> 00:05:10.410
seeing if there is a murmur,

00:05:10.410 --> 00:05:12.130
seeing if your heart's beating normally,

00:05:12.130 --> 00:05:15.440
go see your doctor, find out
